# With an empty graveyard Astelli Reclaimer's enters trigger has no legal target and is removed from the game as it would
# go on the stack (CR 603.3d): no target is asked and nothing is returned. It is cast for its warp cost, paid with a Plains
# and two Moxen (tapped, not sacrificed), so the graveyard stays empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Astelli Reclaimer
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Astelli Reclaimer.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Astelli Reclaimer

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
